==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|leyfa|lang=non}}.

===Pronunciation===
*{{IPA|[ˈleiːva]|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|eiːva|lang=is}}
*: Homophones: [[leifa]]

===Verb===
'''leyfa''' (+{{dat}} / +{{accusative}}) (''weak conjugation:'' [[leyfði]] – [[leyft]])

# to [[permit]], to give [[permission]], to [[allow]]
#: ''Ég '''leyfði''' honum [[leika sér]] með boltann.''
#:: I '''gave''' him '''permission''' to play with his ball.

